==Trivia==
The shiny super rare card was released in the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion, which focuses heavily on the [[Generation II]] [[core series]] games and the [[Johto]] region, and thus is likely a reference to the [[red Gyarados]] found at the [[Lake of Rage]] in {{game5|Gold|Silver|Crystal|HeartGold|SoulSilver}}.

===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Gyarados}}.
*'''Rampaging Whirlpool''' is a variation on {{m|Whirlpool}}, a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Gyarados}} can learn.

